<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan burns 9.93 tonnes of seized hashish.</title>
<headline>Pakistan burns 9.93 tonnes of seized hashish.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani customs authorities on Monday burned 9.93 tonnes of hashish seized from smugglers this year, a customs spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said the hashish had been found near Port Qasim from where it was to be smuggled to Europe and the United States. The spokesman did not disclose the street value of the haul.</p>
</text>
